# Teman UMKM Kita — Project Rules

Baca juga: [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md)

## Git
- Feature branch: `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/` + kebab-case — jangan commit langsung ke `main`
- Commit: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`)
- Merge ke `main` = auto-deploy Vercel
- JANGAN rebase atau force push
- Hapus branch setelah di-merge

## Stack
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript 5 strict, Tailwind CSS 3, Framer Motion
- Backend: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0, bcrypt (NOT passlib), JWT
- DB: MySQL, hosting: Vercel + LiteSpeed Passenger

## Penting
- JANGAN pakai `passlib` — broken di Python 3.13, gunakan `bcrypt` langsung
- JANGAN commit `.env`
- CORS: dua domain (temanumkmkita.com + api.temanumkmkita.com)
- Backend deploy manual — frontend auto via Vercel
- Semua admin API endpoint wajib JWT auth (`require_auth`)
